# Generated by test_neo_hard_aggr (zkp_driver.rs): holds the ABSOLUTE path
# of the scan file it just wrote, derived from proj_root().  It is rewritten
# before it is read, so the committed copy was never an input -- and it
# embedded the author's home directory.  Ignore the file only; the other
# 318 tracked fixtures under debug/ are real inputs and must stay (see
# debug/.gitignore for the 7 scratch subdirectories that are not; the
# one stray file it used to list, test1.bin, turned out to be read by
# three manifests and is tracked again).
debug/neo_hard_aggr_set/binexec.dat
# Licence texts for the binexec corpus: bulk boilerplate (52 files) that
# INSTALL.py restores verbatim from the Zenodo deposit, so it is not kept
# in git.  manifest/ (including its DATASET_BINEXEC.md) IS tracked -- it is
# what a reviewer reads to see what the corpus holds and to check licence
# compliance BEFORE downloading 327 MB.
licenses/
